Test images in data/testset/ are derived from the Pyro-SDIS dataset
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/pyronear/pyro-sdis), licensed Apache-2.0,
created by the Pyronear association with French fire and rescue services.
Modifications: frames were downscaled to 160x96 pixels and re-encoded as JPEG.
Annotations (smoke boxes) are the dataset's own, rescaled to the same frame.
The model in models/ was trained on other cameras of the same dataset.
